{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026QttYkm7MRY1794471484.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>[16:15]</p><p>天文台：隨著高空擾動靠近，本港近期較晴朗的天氣將會有所改變，預料明日（11月13日）下午開始逐漸有幾陣驟雨，晚上驟雨增多及有幾陣狂風雷暴，風勢增強，星期六（11月14日）初時雨勢頗大。</p><p></p><p>市民請留意天文台的最新天氣消息，進行戶外活動時亦要時刻注意天氣變化。隨著高空擾動遠離，星期六日間驟雨減少，天色好轉，下午部分時間有陽光。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://www.hko.gov.hk/tc/wxinfo/currwx/fnd.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">九天天氣預報</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T09:24:01.722586+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T08:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T12:17:17.541530+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T09:17:23.518203+00:00","content_hash":"51d74e734057110e5096453aa70dc6530a80609b1d9fa3139644623840640afb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}